# 统一使用 LF 行尾，禁止 Windows 检出时转成 CRLF。
# 文本文件由 git 自动识别，二进制文件保持原样。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
